 url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-126340688,imgsize-907692.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA[Before Nicolas Maduro, it was Manuel Noriega]]></title><description>&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/126340838.cms" /&gt;<![CDATA[The US captured Venezuelan leader Nicolás Maduro on Saturday, drawing parallels to the 1989 capture of Panama's Manuel Noriega. Both leaders faced US drug-trafficking indictments, and the US military presence increased prior to their captures. While Noriega declared war, Maduro sought to avoid conflict, a plea rejected by Trump.]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/rest-of-world/before-nicolas-maduro-it-was-manuel-noriega/articleshow/126340838.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/rest-of-world/before-nicolas-maduro-it-was-manuel-noriega/articleshow/126340838.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-01-05T03:46:02+05:30</pubDate><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-126340894,imgsize-134654.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA[Venezuela has world's largest oil reserve, but output just 1% of total]]></title><description>&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/126340355.cms" /&gt;<![CDATA[President Trump suggested US oil companies could revitalize Venezuela's struggling industry, potentially generating significant profits. Despite holding vast reserves, Venezuela produces only about 1 million barrels daily due to dilapidated infrastructure and lack of capital. While Chevron remains, significant investment would be required for substantial production increases.]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us/venezuela-has-worlds-largest-oil-reserve-but-output-just-1-of-total/articleshow/126340355.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us/venezuela-has-worlds-largest-oil-reserve-but-output-just-1-of-total/articleshow/126340355.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-01-05T03:40:08+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">Stanley Reed</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-126340508,imgsize-150186.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA['Been mayor for 72 hours': MAGA ally slams Mamdani for calling Trump regarding Maduro's capture]]></title><description>&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/126340062.cms" /&gt;<![CDATA[]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us/been-mayor-for-72-hours-maga-ally-slams-mamdani-for-calling-trump-regarding-maduros-capture/articleshow/126340062.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us/been-mayor-for-72-hours-maga-ally-slams-mamdani-for-calling-trump-regarding-maduros-capture/articleshow/126340062.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-01-05T03:05:31+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">TOI World Desk</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-126340062,imgsize-1054087.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA[Rubio says US won't govern Venezuela, clarifies Trump’s 'run the country' remarks]]></title><description>&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/126339997.cms" /&gt;<![CDATA[]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us/rubio-says-us-wont-govern-venezuela-clarifies-trumps-run-the-country-remarks/articleshow/126339997.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us/rubio-says-us-wont-govern-venezuela-clarifies-trumps-run-the-country-remarks/articleshow/126339997.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-01-05T02:09:58+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator x