https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/middle-east/dubai-fine-warning-jebel-hafeet-bbq-ban-explained-new-uae-outdoor-rules-for-al-ain-mountain-visitors/articleshow/126334903.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/middle-east/dubai-fine-warning-jebel-hafeet-bbq-ban-explained-new-uae-outdoor-rules-for-al-ain-mountain-visitors/articleshow/126334903.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-01-04T19:26:36+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">TOI World Desk</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-126335606,imgsize-84240.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA[UAE tightens traffic rules again: Abu Dhabi’s Dh2,000 penalty for noisy vehicles explained]]></title><description>&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/126336176.cms" /&gt;<![CDATA[Abu Dhabi is intensifying its campaign against noisy vehicles, imposing hefty Dh2,000 fines and 12 black points for disruptive driving. Authorities are cracking down on unauthorised modifications and reckless behaviour to ensure community peace and road safety.  This move aims to curb noise pollution and promote courteous driving, with public reporting encouraged.]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/middle-east/uae-tightens-traffic-rules-again-abu-dhabis-dh2000-penalty-for-noisy-vehicles-explained/articleshow/126336176.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/middle-east/uae-tightens-traffic-rules-again-abu-dhabis-dh2000-penalty-for-noisy-vehicles-explained/articleshow/126336176.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-01-04T20:50:26+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">TOI World Desk</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-126336365,imgsize-47910.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA[How Burj Khalifa still defies wind, heat, gravity in 2026: Engineering secrets of world’s tallest building revealed]]></title><description>&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/126336624.cms" /&gt;<![CDATA[The Burj Khalifa's remarkable height and stability are attributed to Bill Baker's pioneering buttressed core system, which ingeniously combats wind forces and torsional stress. This innovative design, refined through extensive wind-tunnel testing and advanced materials, allows the 828-meter skyscraper to withstand Dubai's harsh environmental conditions and remain a benchmark of engineering excellence.]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/middle-east/how-burj-khalifa-in-dubai-still-defies-wind-heat-gravity-in-2026-engineering-secrets-of-worlds-tallest-building-revealed/articleshow/126336624.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/middle-east/how-burj-khalifa-in-dubai-still-defies-wind-heat-gravity-in-2026-engineering-secrets-of-worlds-tallest-building-revealed/articleshow/126336624.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-01-04T22:33:27+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">TOI World Desk</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-126337156,imgsize-85900.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA[Crypto heist in Dubai: Woman swaps wallets in seconds, walks away with $1 million]]></title><description>&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/126339606.cms" /&gt;<![CDATA[A Dubai court sentenced a woman to jail, a hefty fine and deportation for orchestrating a sophisticated cryptocurrency scam. The "wallet swap" scheme involved replacing an investor's hardware wallet during a business meeting, leading to the theft of millions in digital assets. The case highlights the UAE's firm stance on crypto crimes as serious financial offenses.]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/middle-east/crypto-heist-in-dubai-woman-swaps-wallets-in-seconds-walks-away-with-1-million/articleshow/126339606.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/middle-east/crypto-heist-in-dubai-woman-swaps-wallets-in-seconds-walks-away-with-1-million/articleshow/126339606.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-01-05T01:03:21+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">TOI World Desk</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-126339785,imgsize-2650691.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA[Maduro dancing to 'No War, Yes Peace' may have triggered Trump into kidnapping him]]></title><description>&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/126339675.cms" /&gt;<![CDATA[]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us/maduro-dancing-to-no-war-yes-peace-may-have-triggered-trump-into-kidnapping-him-and-bombing-venezuela-report/articleshow/126339675.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us/maduro-dancing-to-no-war-yes-peace-may-have-triggered-trump-into-kidnapping-him-and-bombing-venezuela-report/articleshow/126339675.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-01-05T01:07:48+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">TOI World Desk</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-126339675,imgsize-944784.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA[iShowSpeed pulls a car in viral African strength challenge during Africa tour]]></title><description>&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/126339693.cms" /&gt;<![CDATA[Internet personality IShowSpeed has gone viral again. He completed a strength challenge during his Africa tour. He pulled a car using 